#: cuda.tile._stub.mma_scaled:1 of
msgid "Block-scaled matrix multiply-accumulate."
msgstr "分块缩放（Block-scaled）矩阵乘加。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma_scaled:3 of
msgid ""
"Computes a matrix multiply-accumulate where inputs are scaled by block "
"scales along the K dimension before the mma::"
msgstr "计算矩阵乘加：在进行 MMA 之前，先沿 K 维度按分块缩放因子（block scales）对输入进行缩放： ::"

#: cuda.tile._stub.mma_scaled:9 of
msgid ""
"The scaling block size is ``B = K // K_s``, where ``K_s`` is the K "
"dimension of the scale tile. ``K`` must be divisible by ``K_s``, and "
"``B`` must be one of the allowed values listed in the table below."
msgstr ""
"缩放分块大小为 ``B = K // K_s`` ，其中 ``K_s`` 是缩放因子 Tile 的 K 维度大小。 ``K`` 必须能被 "
"``K_s`` 整除，且 ``B`` 必须为下表列出的允许值之一。"

