#: cuda.tile._stub.mma_scaled:38 of
msgid ""
"Batch dimensions of x and y are broadcast against each other (same as "
":func:`mma`). x_scale's batch dimension must match x's batch exactly, and"
" y_scale's batch dimension must match y's batch exactly; both are then "
"broadcast to the output batch shape."
msgstr ""
"``x`` 和 ``y`` 的批处理维度会相互广播（与 :func:`mma` 相同）。 ``x_scale`` 的批处理维度必须与 ``x`` "
"完全匹配， ``y_scale`` 的批处理维度必须与 ``y`` 完全匹配；随后两者均会广播至输出批处理形状。"

